{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.563, "n_samples": 85518, "proc_s": 1.2415, "rtf": 0.3484, "samples_sha256": "63356220f87b883d70a90e774323e818b752e1470205aeeb2b6b30e384b81795"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.972, "n_samples": 95317, "proc_s": 1.4722, "rtf": 0.3707, "samples_sha256": "9f00b7970dbfd02dd993c9e2da037f94fd7f2539dcfe412be8e468c0d2676491"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.927, "n_samples": 70258, "proc_s": 0.8614, "rtf": 0.2943, "samples_sha256": "9a60b1197488938c2098f7040fc685cc28e18ce36317ebb64716bf6b767e8339"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.023, "n_samples": 72542, "proc_s": 0.8563, "rtf": 0.2833, "samples_sha256": "da142f12c9f0244e61c6f1bff64eaabc9390389a5e3a2309e2297fbcac8b3ef5"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.603, "n_samples": 62461, "proc_s": 0.8346, "rtf": 0.3207, "samples_sha256": "969e7db2840c8e0dfcf366ad840317b6f1f0dd763d96f9dc150473665613976a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.825, "n_samples": 67802, "proc_s": 1.0648, "rtf": 0.3769, "samples_sha256": "105566441eeb45c4e59507493443c6d12c5ec7d5f313ca677913703079d57081"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.096, "n_samples": 98313, "proc_s": 1.7014, "rtf": 0.4153, "samples_sha256": "45c2e52fab789dd4a2328f4bc073e5f4e450aa7a08543dfa758c05dcf132b1b6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.121, "n_samples": 74915, "proc_s": 0.9762, "rtf": 0.3127, "samples_sha256": "ac6c96d7992c1deeb3f51886582bb74d73854ac82c604c66b836ad50b30d789c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.267, "n_samples": 78397, "proc_s": 1.0705, "rtf": 0.3277, "samples_sha256": "fe2d931e563f1154e18eb902e1ca9ff8ace232c93d576f064a22bc5b8214b678"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.482, "n_samples": 83564, "proc_s": 1.1849, "rtf": 0.3403, "samples_sha256": "a6efe9f53232918f0f2ae4faffcace60509c7c6a027cc5839e7288a77ee1cfc4"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.427, "n_samples": 58245, "proc_s": 0.9796, "rtf": 0.4037, "samples_sha256": "624f802f19fe803a0795655bda80e0f1119bbfada7003116942697d9f8aee401"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.36, "n_samples": 80635, "proc_s": 0.9851, "rtf": 0.2932, "samples_sha256": "e57cef43b49e75c7264b3614c41f551a3af7c9038b515ea0b779e7483d415a5c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.48, "n_samples": 83526, "proc_s": 1.1128, "rtf": 0.3197, "samples_sha256": "c2789dd371e46c66fd48d2e1982a854de0fdbc8e962ec01191b99acc0763a65f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.497, "n_samples": 107934, "proc_s": 1.5233, "rtf": 0.3387, "samples_sha256": "2aa0bd240f4176fc4ccbceabe395c17c411e7312710250e82510dca17d1fd397"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.126, "n_samples": 75015, "proc_s": 1.022, "rtf": 0.327, "samples_sha256": "95697ec097fa1f310ce85199b5f1004795a356d1c73e07eaf08549d1c42eb593"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.94, "n_samples": 70568, "proc_s": 0.8451, "rtf": 0.2874, "samples_sha256": "18c0cb1b6ca73037aef22416fa64081480e53a70e2746d3d70c75eaadffb3085"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.43, "n_samples": 82327, "proc_s": 1.1903, "rtf": 0.347, "samples_sha256": "3200a299447167ac287e8214cce4efce51208ba2dfa824643987faf99f3f8e2e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.028, "n_samples": 72678, "proc_s": 0.9351, "rtf": 0.3088, "samples_sha256": "a417a6a99600f20d5ded3c535021458b71118a7c3208c326b354f542d2b43332"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 1.87, "n_samples": 44870, "proc_s": 0.5874, "rtf": 0.3142, "samples_sha256": "0d05aec6b51c3326453e9d1be60451ece8632e57c228c72892929506c5594e3f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.337, "n_samples": 80089, "proc_s": 1.0831, "rtf": 0.3246, "samples_sha256": "1af77889d62625357ebf4b4d9371f1e8b508e93cf79da88e6803550ac0586211"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.202, "n_samples": 76856, "proc_s": 1.1967, "rtf": 0.3737, "samples_sha256": "b0e9930980f461f43e4c45b642171c7d6d820a94b5143e00e69b6db32abf720e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.853, "n_samples": 92468, "proc_s": 1.2983, "rtf": 0.337, "samples_sha256": "1a5a495b71ad3ad8a0ea74752b0c55128f347145a5098fe79a545e27072c71f1"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.412, "n_samples": 81878, "proc_s": 0.9841, "rtf": 0.2885, "samples_sha256": "2110de13fff9e5e17bd55b60b2ee80d808194d05f05174df1e8c2ab5acc9a985"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.591, "n_samples": 86176, "proc_s": 1.4626, "rtf": 0.4073, "samples_sha256": "959cbae257390c59eb6c5e4ca456a9d219d9839f57b32c3ba61c1bcf670b042d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.386, "n_samples": 81276, "proc_s": 1.177, "rtf": 0.3476, "samples_sha256": "31418a500251282e260036e379019ea969cb84bed5c82a8d05dca510921922ec"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.763, "n_samples": 66305, "proc_s": 0.8186, "rtf": 0.2963, "samples_sha256": "0e3371b583ab7d513800b374a9547e9e32c12c6777eeb1e45be9f591d7af7a8b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.708, "n_samples": 88980, "proc_s": 1.011, "rtf": 0.2727, "samples_sha256": "553273568035ecbe27859e53fa8ec952b4d55f9583e9e6b25b6854b139763b21"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s028", "text": "医生建议我每天喝8杯水。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.377, "n_samples": 57048, "proc_s": 0.7066, "rtf": 0.2973, "samples_sha256": "68b1883754102abc37e76a3536916bc85811baeaf60588fd8d3f4140e4270c0a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s029", "text": "我们团队一共有12个人，分成3个小组。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.8, "n_samples": 91208, "proc_s": 1.2832, "rtf": 0.3377, "samples_sha256": "2a9b9a02264aa20beb6cc0ef4f6a3ef8f87179867bc79099e6df1b33c850543b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid49", "sentence_id": "s030", "text": "谢谢你的帮忙，下次我请你喝咖啡。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.276, "n_samples": 78615, "proc_s": 1.082, "rtf": 0.3303, "samples_sha256": "5fa66b7b0229705e74c966fd3b566cb4ad3b04ed913dcaaa96d94942b0a3cf98"}
